Tsinghua University Thesis (ThuThesis) (typage/thuthesis) - license

This template contains files from two sources.

  main.tex, refs.bib, manifest.json, typage.json, LICENSE
      Written by 7D24H. CC0-1.0: dedicated to the public domain; documents
      written from this template need no attribution.
      https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

  thuthesis.cls, thuthesis-*.bst, thuthesis-*.bbx, thuthesis-*.cbx,
  thu-fig-logo.pdf, thu-text-logo.pdf
      ThuThesis 7.7.1 (2026/05/26), the Tsinghua University thesis
      template, Copyright the Tsinghua University TUNA Association (the
      bibliography styles: Zeping Lee), under the LaTeX Project Public
      License 1.3c, as stated in the file headers and the project README
      (https://github.com/tuna/thuthesis). As distributed by CTAN
      (https://mirrors.ctan.org/install/macros/latex/contrib/thuthesis.tds.zip). Redistributed unmodified, so that the
      template compiles offline. The logo files show the emblem and name of
      Tsinghua University, for theses of that university.

The fonts (Fandol) and the other packages come from the built-in Tectonic
bundle under their own licenses. Check the current requirements of the
Tsinghua University graduate school or academic affairs office before
submitting.
